#### LLM Autofill Integration Rules

```typescript
// Frontend: Cursor state management
function handleFieldFocus(field: HTMLInputElement) {
  field.style.cursor = "wait"; // Processing state

  // Call LLM service
  const suggestion = await window.electronAPI.getAutofillSuggestion(context);

  if (suggestion.suggestion) {
    field.value = suggestion.suggestion;
    field.style.cursor = "text"; // Standard state
  } else if (suggestion.question) {
    // Show OS-level input prompt
    const userInput = await showInputPrompt(suggestion.question);
    await window.electronAPI.saveToProfile(userInput, fieldType);
  }
}
```

### 6. Security & Performance Rules

#### Electron Security

```javascript
// Main window security
new BrowserWindow({
  webPreferences: {
    nodeIntegration: false, // Disable Node.js in renderer
    contextIsolation: true, // Isolate context
    enableRemoteModule: false, // Disable remote module
    preload: path.join(__dirname, "preload.js"),
  },
});

// Prevent new window creation
app.on("web-contents-created", (event, contents) => {
  contents.on("new-window", (event, navigationUrl) => {
    event.preventDefault();
    // Handle in current browser view instead
  });
});
```

#### Performance Optimization

- **Lazy Loading**: Load PDF.js worker only when needed
- **Memory Management**: Clear PDF data when switching tabs
- **Event Cleanup**: Remove all listeners in useEffect cleanup
- **Debounced Updates**: Use debouncing for resize events

